This song was a bit hard to figure out, but it's just so
beautiful and I really wanted to tab it!I saw other tabs
on the net that were completely wrong (in standard tuning)
I think it's easy to understand that the guitars are tuned
down half-a-step.The most difficult part to figure out was
the intro/verse where I'm not really surewhat he plays, but
I think that my version sound more or less right.there are
some chords that I play in different ways so I'll write it down
here and you'll decide what you prefer:

